gomodel:6a4e740f00000268
        a                      owl:Ontology ;
        rdfs:comment           "General: Curated by claude4go (v3). Rebuild of v2 (gomodel:6a4e740f00000205) to also give every activity its OWN part_of BP individual and occurs_in CC individual (no shared context instances), extending the distinct-individuals-per-activity-unit rule beyond has_input/enabled_by. Spine: IGF1R>PI3K>AKT (PMID:19951971,TAS) -| FOXO4 (PMID:10217147); FOXO4/FOXO3 activate CDKN1B/p27 -> G1/S arrest (PMID:10783894,PMID:18393360); c-Myc corepressor -| FOXO3 (PMID:18393360). SCP4/CTDSPL2 dephosphorylates/activates FOXO1/FOXO3 (PMID:28851713). FOXO1 -> G6PC1,PCK1 (PMID:28851713); PGC-1a coactivator -> G6PC1 parallel arm (PMID:17024043, argues PGC-1a effect on G6Pase is independent of FOXO1). AS160/TBC1D4 (PMID:11994271) peripheral AKT substrate, per curator request." , "General: Merged PR as a test for the 2026-07-30 Noctua outage." , "Created with GO AI HUB." ;
        lego:conforms_to_gpad  false ;
        lego:modelstate        "development" ;
        dc:contributor         "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1813-6857" , "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8534-6582" , "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-9059-1333" ;
        dc:date                "2026-07-30" ;
        dc:title               "FOXO-CDKN1B signaling (HUMAN)" ;
        pav:providedBy         "http://www.pombase.org" , "http://geneontology.org" , "http://greekc.org" ;
        biolink:in_taxon       obo:NCBITaxon_9606 .

